     7710         with frame a view-as dialog-box side-labels three-d
     7711         title "Обработка товаров" .
     7712       display
     7713         p-obj-type p-obj-code
     7714         with frame a .
     7715       run log-information in this-procedure
     7716         (input p-obj-type
     7717         ,input p-obj-code
     7718         ,input "Обработка товаров"
     7719         ) .
     7720       for each buf_gds-obj no-lock
     7721         where buf_gds-obj.obj-type = p-obj-type
     7722           and buf_gds-obj.obj-code = p-obj-code
     7723       on error undo, return error return-value
     7724       :
     7725         assign
     7726           v-ind = v-ind + 1
     7727         .
     7728         if v-ind mod 10 = 0
     7729         then do:
     7730           display
     7731             v-ind skip
     7732             buf_gds-obj.artic skip
     7733             v-total-err skip
     7734             with frame a .
     7735         end.
     7736         run process-gds-obj in this-procedure
     7737           (input buf_gds-obj.obj-type
     7738           ,input buf_gds-obj.obj-code
     7739           ,input buf_gds-obj.gds-code
     7740           ,input v-day-end-fact-order
